.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
# M13 Phase 9: every dotenv variant, not just the bare .env -- defense
# in depth. The primary guarantee is structural (docker-compose.yml's
# build.context is ./backend, so .env.prod at the repo root is never
# even part of the build context to begin with), but this still guards
# a future accidental `backend/.env.prod` or a differently-invoked
# `docker build backend/`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
